# Usage log tool keys

`log_ai_call(tool=...)` keys are registered in `usage_tools.py`. Do not invent a new string and only use it at the call site.

- Add a display name to `TOOL_LABELS`.
- If it is an internal step of an existing product (OCR, extra API hop), add it to `STEP_OF`. The firm dashboard will hide it from uses / by-tool / charts. Costs still roll up via `provider` (openai vs google_documentai).
- If it is the same product under another key (redo, retry), add it to `ALIAS_OF`.
- Leave admin `/admin/usage` uncollapsed so steps stay visible there.
- Do not show per-tool costs on the firm dashboard.
- Firm-facing cost KPIs and the cost chart are gated by `usage_dashboard_show_costs` (off by default).
